<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">I Tesalonisyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">I TESALONISYEN YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">I Tesalonisyen Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">I Tes</para>
  <para style="mt1">I TESALONISYEN YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TH 1:1">II Tes 1:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Paul, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:19">II Kor 1:19</ref></char></note>Silvain ak Timothée a legliz Tesalonisyen yo nan Bondye, Papa a ak Senyè a, Jésus Kri: Lagras pou nou ak lapè.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:8">Wo 1:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nou bay remèsiman a Bondye tout tan pou nou tout e nonmen non nou nan lapriyè nou yo. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>San rete nou sonje travay lafwa nou an, ak èv <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 13:13">I Kor 13:13</ref></char></note>lanmou nou yo; jan nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:25">Wo 8:25</ref></char></note>kenbe fèm nan esperans de Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri, devan prezans a Bondye, Papa nou. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Nou konprann, frè byeneme pa Bondye yo, chwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:10">II Pi 1:10</ref></char></note>Li menm de nou an. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Ke levanjil pa nou an pa t vini a nou menm nan pawòl sèlman, men osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:19">Wo 15:19</ref></char></note>nan pouvwa ak nan Lespri Sen an. Li te vini avèk tout asirans, jis jan ou konnen ki kalite moun nou te ye pami nou an, pou koz a nou.<verse eid="1TH 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/>Nou osi te devni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:16">I Kor 4:16</ref></char></note>imitatè a nou menm e a Senyè a. Konsa, nou te resevwa pawòl la nan anpil tribilasyon, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:52">Trav 13:52</ref></char></note>lajwa Lespri Sen an. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Konsa, nou te devni yon egzanp pou tout kwayan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:26">Wo 15:26</ref></char></note>Macédoine ak nan Achaïe yo. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16">Kol 3:16</ref></char></note>pawòl a Senyè a te deklare soti nan nou menm, non sèlman nan Macédoine ak Achaïe, men osi chak kote ke lafwa nou anvè Bondye te vin konnen, pou nou pa bezwen di anyen.<verse eid="1TH 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Paske yo menm bay rapò de nou; sou jan ou te resevwa nou, ak jan nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:15">Trav 14:15</ref></char></note>te vire vè Bondye pou kite zidòl yo, pou sèvi yon Bondye vivan e vrè, <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>epi pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:7">I Kor 1:7</ref></char></note>tann Fis Li a soti nan syèl la. Sila Li te fè leve soti nan lanmò a, ki se Jésus, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:9">Wo 5:9</ref></char></note>delivre nou anba kòlè k ap vini an.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Paske nou menm konnen, frè m yo, ke aparans nou pami nou menm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:10">II Tes 1:10</ref></char></note>pa t anven. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/>Men apre nou te deja soufri e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:5">Trav 14:5</ref></char></note>maltrete nan Philippes, jan nou konnen an, nou te gen kouraj nan Bondye nou an pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">Trav 17:1-9</ref></char></note>pale levanjil la avèk nou malgre anpil opozisyon.<verse eid="1TH 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Paske egzòtasyon nou an pa soti ni nan erè, ni nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:7">I Tes 4:7</ref></char></note>salte, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:2">II Kwo 4:2</ref></char></note>nan fason pou twonpe moun. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Men jis jan nou te vin apwouve pa Bondye a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:7">Gal 2:7</ref></char></note>vin konfye nou levanjil la; alò nou pale, pa pou fè lòm plezi, men pou Bondye ki egzamine kè nou yo.<verse eid="1TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Paske nou pa t janm vini avèk pawòl k ap flate moun, jan nou konnen an, ni avèk yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:33">Trav 20:33</ref></char></note>pretèks pou fè lajan (Bondye se temwen) <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>ni nou pa t <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:41">Jn 5:41</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 5:44">44</ref></char></note>chache glwa ki sòti nan lòm, ni nan nou menm, ni nan lòt yo, menmsi kòm apot a Kris, nou ta dwe montre otorite nou. <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>Men nou te pwouve nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:24">II Tim 2:24</ref></char></note>plen dousè pami nou, tankou yon manman nouris ki byen pran swen pwòp pitit li.<verse eid="1TH 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Avèk bon jan afeksyon ke nou te gen pou nou an, nou te byen kontan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 12:15">II Kor 12:15</ref></char></note>pataje non sèlman levanjil a Bondye a, men osi pwòp lavi nou, paske nou te devni trè chè a nou menm.<verse eid="1TH 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Paske nou sonje, frè yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:8">II Tes 3:8</ref></char></note>travay ak difikilte nou. Jan nou te travay lannwit kou lajounen pou nou pa t yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">II Kor 11:9</ref></char></note>chaj pou okenn nan nou. Konsa nou te pwoklame a nou menm levanjil a Bondye a. <verse eid="1TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Nou se temwen, e Bondye osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:12">II Kor 1:12</ref></char></note>de jan nou te konpòte ak devwe nou an, dwat e san fot anvè nou menm, kwayan yo.<verse eid="1TH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>Jis kon nou konnen jan nou t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:14">I Tes 5:14</ref></char></note>egzòte, ankouraje e plede ak nou chak, tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 4:14">I Kor 4:14</ref></char></note>yon papa ta dwe fè pwòp pitit li, <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>pou nou ta kab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:1">Ef 4:1</ref></char></note>mache nan yon fason ki dign pou Bondye kap rele nou antre nan pwòp wayòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 4:6">II Kor 4:6</ref></char></note>ak laglwa Li a.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Pou rezon sa a, nou, tout tan, bay Bondye remèsiman ke lè nou te resevwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:17">Wo 10:17</ref></char></note>pawòl Bondye nou te tande de nou an, nou te aksepte li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:20">Mat 10:20</ref></char></note>pa kòm yon pawòl a lòm, men pou sa li vrèman ye a, pawòl Bondye a, ki anplis fè travay li nan nou menm ki kwè yo.<verse eid="1TH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/>Paske nou menm, frè m yo, nou te devni imitatè a legliz Bondye nan Kris Jésus ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:22">Gal 1:22</ref></char></note>an Judée yo. Konsa, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Trav 17:5</ref></char></note>te andire menm soufrans sa yo nan men a pwòp moun peyi parèy a nou yo, jan yo menm te andire l nan men a Jwif yo.<verse eid="1TH 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:20">Luc 24:20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sila ki te touye Senyè a Jésus ak pwofèt yo, e ki te fòse nou sòti. Yo p ap fè Bondye plezi, men yo se lènmi a tout moun. <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Yo anpeche nou pale avèk etranje yo pou yo kapab sove. Kon rezilta yo toujou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:16">Jen 15:16</ref></char></note>ranpli mezi peche pa yo. Men lakolè gen tan vini sou yo pi rèd.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Men nou menm, frè yo, akoz ke nou te separe de nou pou yon ti tan—<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:3">I Kor 5:3</ref></char></note>kòmsi an pèsòn, men pa an espri—nou tout te pi empasyan ak lanvi pou wè figi nou. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Paske nou tout te vle vin kote nou—mwen menm, Paul, plis ke yon sèl fwa—e malgre sa, Satan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Wo 1:13</ref></char></note>te anpeche nou.<verse eid="1TH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Paske kilès ki esperans nou, oubyen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:1">Fil 4:1</ref></char></note>lajwa nou, oubyen kouwòn egzaltasyon an? Èske se pa menm nou menm nan, nan prezans a Senyè nou an nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref></char></note>moman retou Li a. <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Paske nou se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:14">II Kor 1:14</ref></char></note>laglwa ak lajwa nou.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>Konsa, lè nou pa t kapab andire l ankò, nou te panse ke li te pi bon pou yo kite nou dèyè nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Trav 17:15</ref></char></note>Athènes sèl. <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>Konsa, nou te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:1">II Kor 1:1</ref></char></note>Timothée, frè nou ak ouvriye Bondye parèy a nou nan levanjil a Kris la, pou ranfòse e ankouraje nou nan lafwa nou, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>pou pèsòn pa twouble pa afliksyon sila yo, paske nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:16">Trav 9:16</ref></char></note>nou te destine pou sa. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Paske, vrèman, lè nou te avèk nou an, nou te konn ap di nou davans ke nou t ap pral soufri afliksyon yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:14">I Tes 2:14</ref></char></note>e se konsa li te vin pase, jan nou konnen an.<verse eid="1TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>Pou rezon sa a, lè mwen pa t kapab andire li ankò, mwen osi te voye enfòme de lafwa nou, avèk krent pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:3">Mat 4:3</ref></char></note>tantatè a ta ka petèt vin tante nou, e pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:1">II Kwo 6:1</ref></char></note>travay nou an ta anven.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>Men koulye a, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Trav 18:5</ref></char></note>Timothée gen tan menm vin jwenn nou soti kote nou, li te pote bannou bòn nouvèl de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:3">I Tes 1:3</ref></char></note>lafwa ak lanmou nou, e ke nou toujou panse avèk tandrès de nou menm, e anvi wè nou jis jan ke nou anvi wè nou tou a. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Pou rezon sa a, frè m yo, nan tout detrès ak afliksyon nou yo, nou te rekonfòte de nou menm atravè lafwa nou. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>Paske koulye a, nou vrèman ap viv, si nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:13">I Kwo 16:13</ref></char></note>kanpe fèm nan Senyè a.<verse eid="1TH 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:2">I Tes 1:2</ref></char></note>ki remèsiman nou kapab bay Bondye anretou pou tout jwa ki fè nou rejwi devan Bondye akoz ou menm? <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>Antretan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:3">II Tim 1:3</ref></char></note>lajounen kou lannwit, nou kontinye ap priye fò pou nou kab wè figi nou, e pou nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 13:9">II Kor 13:9</ref></char></note>konplete sa ki manke nan konnesans lafwa nou.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Koulye a, ke Bondye e Papa nou an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 5:23">I Tes 5:23</ref></char></note>Li Menm, ak Jésus, Senyè nou an, dirije chemen nou anvè ou menm. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Epi ke Senyè a kapab fè nou grandi e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:9">Fil 1:9</ref></char></note>ogmante nan lanmou youn pou lòt, e pou tout moun, jis jan nou osi fè pou nou an. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Pou Li kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">I Kor 1:8</ref></char></note>etabli kè nou san fot, nan sentete devan Bondye, Papa nou an, nan lè retou Senyè nou an avèk tout sen Li yo.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>Alò, finalman, frè m yo, nou mande e ankouraje nou nan Senyè a Jésus, ke menm jan nou te resevwa lenstriksyon nan men nou an, ak jan nou ta dwe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:1">Ef 4:1</ref></char></note>mache pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:9">II Kor 5:9</ref></char></note>fè Bondye plezi a (menm jan ke vrèman n ap mache a), pou nou kapab fè plis pwogrè toujou. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Paske nou konnen ki kòmandman nou te bannou yo pa otorite Senyè a Jésus.<verse eid="1TH 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Paske sa se volonte Bondye; pou nou vin sen nèt. Konsa,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:18">I Kor 6:18</ref></char></note>pa fè imoralite seksyèl, <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 7:2">I Kwo 7:2</ref>,<ref loc="1CH 7:9">9</ref></char></note>chak nan nou kapab konnen jan pou posede pwòp veso li nan sanktifikasyon ak lonè, <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>pa nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:26">Wo 1:26</ref></char></note>pasyon lanvi lachè, tankou payen ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:8">Gal 4:8</ref></char></note>pa konnen Bondye yo; <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>epi pou pèsòn pa transgrese e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:8">I Kor 6:8</ref></char></note>vòlè frè l nan bagay sila, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:19">Wo 12:19</ref></char></note>Senyè a se vanjè a nan tout bagay sila yo, jis jan nou te osi di nou deja a, e te avèti nou byen serye a.<verse eid="1TH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Paske Bondye pa t rele nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:3">I Tes 2:3</ref></char></note>pou fè salte, men nan sanktifikasyon. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Donk, sila ki rejte sa a, p ap rejte lòm, men Bondye ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:5">Wo 5:5</ref></char></note>bannou Lespri Sen Li an.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>Alò, jan pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Jn 13:34</ref></char></note>lanmou pou frè nou yo, nou pa bezwen pèsòn ekri nou, paske nou menm, nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:27">I Jn 2:27</ref></char></note>enstwi pa Bondye pou nou renmen youn lòt. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Paske, vrèman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:7">I Tes 1:7</ref></char></note>nou pratike sa anvè tout frè ki an Macédoine yo. Men nou egzòte nou, frè yo, pou nou fè plis pwogrè toujou, <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>epi pou nou fè l dezi nou pou mennen yon vi kalm, pou nou okipe nou de pwòp zafè pa nou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Trav 18:3</ref></char></note>travay avèk men nou, jis jan nou te rekòmande nou an. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Konsa nou kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:13">Wo 13:13</ref></char></note>konpòte nou byen anvè moun deyò legliz yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:28">Ef 4:28</ref></char></note>pou nou pa manke anyen.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Men nou pa vle nou manke konnen, frè m yo, de sila ki mouri yo, pou nou pa atriste menm jan ak lòt ki pa gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:12">Ef 2:12</ref></char></note>okenn espwa yo. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Paske si nou kwè ke Jésus te mouri e te leve ankò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:9">Wo 14:9</ref></char></note>menm jan an, Bondye va pote avèk Li menm sila ki gen tan mouri nan Jésus yo.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Paske nou di nou sa selon pawòl Senyè a, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:52">I Kor 15:52</ref></char></note>nou menm ki vivan yo, e ki rete jiska <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:19">I Tes 2:19</ref></char></note>vini Senyè a, nou p ap rive avan sila ki gen tan mouri yo.<verse eid="1TH 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Paske Senyè a Li menm va desann soti nan syèl la avèk yon gwo kri, avèk vwa akanj lan e avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:31">Mat 24:31</ref></char></note>twonpèt Bondye a. Konsa, mò an Kris yo va leve premyèman. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:52">I Kor 15:52</ref></char></note>nou menm ki vivan, e ki rete yo, va jwenn nou ansanm avèk yo nan nyaj yo pou rankontre Senyè a anlè. Se konsa, nou va avèk Senyè a jis pou tout tan.<verse eid="1TH 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Pou sa a, rekonfòte youn lòt avèk pawòl sa yo.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Alò, konsènan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:7">Trav 1:7</ref></char></note>tan ak epòk yo, frè m yo, nou pa bezwen ekri nou anyen. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/>Paske nou menm, nou konnen trè byen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:8">I Kor 1:8</ref></char></note>jou a Senyè a va vini sou nou tankou yon vòlè lannwit. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Pandan y ap di “Lapè ak sekirite”, alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:9">II Tes 1:9</ref></char></note>destriksyon va vini sou yo sibitman, tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:21">Jn 16:21</ref></char></note>doulè a yon fanm k ap fè pitit. E yo p ap chape.<verse eid="1TH 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Men nou menm, frè m yo, nou pa nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:18">Trav 26:18</ref></char></note>tenèb, pou jou a ta siprann nou tankou yon vòlè. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>Paske nou tout se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:8">Luc 16:8</ref></char></note>fis a limyè e fis lajounen an. Nou pa apatyen a lannwit ni a tenèb. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Konsa, annou pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:11">Wo 13:11</ref></char></note>dòmi tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:3">Ef 2:3</ref></char></note>lòt yo konn fè a, men annou rete vijilan e rezoli. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Paske sila ki dòmi yo, fè dòmi yo a nan lannwit; e sila kap vin sou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:15">Trav 7:15</ref></char></note>vin sou lannwit. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/>Men paske nou apatyen a lajounen, annou rete rezoli. Annou fin mete sou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">És 59:17</ref></char></note>pwotèj lestomak lafwa ak lanmou an, e kòm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:17">Ef 6:17</ref></char></note>kas, lesperans sali a.<verse eid="1TH 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Paske Bondye pa t destine nou a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 1:10">I Tes 1:10</ref></char></note>lakòlè, men pou nou vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:13">II Tes 2:13</ref></char></note>gen Sali atravè Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:9">Wo 14:9</ref></char></note>Li te mouri pou nou pou kit nou vivan kit nou mouri, nou va viv ansanm avèk Li.<verse eid="1TH 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Konsa, annou ankouraje youn lòt, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:29">Ef 4:29</ref></char></note>remonte youn lòt, jis jan n ap fè a.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Men nou mande nou, frè m yo, pou nou apresye sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:6">Wo 16:6</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 16:12">12</ref></char></note>ki travay avèk dilijans pami nou yo, e ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:17">Eb 13:17</ref></char></note>responsab nou nan Senyè a pou bannou lenstriksyon e korije nou. <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Fòk nou ba yo gwo estim nan lanmou akoz de travay yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 5:13">
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mc 9:50</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Viv nan lapè avèk youn lòt.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Nou egzòte nou anpil, frè m yo, avèti moun san <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:6">II Tim 3:6</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 3:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 3:11">11</ref></char></note>prensip yo, ankouraje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:4">És 35:4</ref></char></note>sila ki manke kouraj yo, ede fèb yo, aji nan pasyans avèk tout moun. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Veye pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:17">Wo 12:17</ref></char></note>pèsòn pa rann youn lòt mal pou mal, men toujou chache sa ki bon pou youn lòt e pou tout moun.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 4:4">Fil 4:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Se pou nou rejwi nou tout tan. <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>Priye san rete. <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>Nan tout bagay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:20">Ef 5:20</ref></char></note>bay remèsiman, paske sa se volonte Bondye pou nou nan Kris Jésus a.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:30">Ef 4:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pa etenn Lespri Sen an. <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>Pa meprize <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:1">Trav 13:1</ref></char></note>pawòl pwofetik yo. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:29">I Kor 14:29</ref></char></note>byen egzamine tout bagay. Kenbe fèm a sa ki bon an <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>e evite tout kalite mal.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>Koulye a, ke Bondye lapè a, Li menm, ki sanktifye nou nèt la, e ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:46">Luc 1:46</ref></char></note>lespri nou, nanm nou ak kò nou kapab konsève nèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 3:14">II Pi 3:14</ref></char></note>san repwòch jis nan vini a Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri.<verse eid="1TH 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:9">I Kor 1:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fidèl se Sila ki rele nou an, e Li osi va fè l rive konsa.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Frè m yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:19">Ef 6:19</ref></char></note>priye pou nou.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:16">Wo 16:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Salye tout frè yo avèk yon bo ki sen. <verse eid="1TH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Mwen bay ou lòd nan non Senyè a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:16">Kol 4:16</ref></char></note>fè lèt sa a li bay tout frè yo.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:20">Wo 16:20</ref></char></note>lagras Senyè nou an, Jésus Kri avèk nou. Amen.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
